{"parentUuid":"1901b54b-ffe6-42b0-8fca-d4fd050b860e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChLP5cAevDvx7QuwZnbeu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#753 is merged and the release branch is green at `66374e97`; no PRs are open.\n\n- **#753:** a signalled `nexus acp` now exits within 10 seconds even if a session never finishes stopping. Its test fails without the fix.\n- **The other #752 follow-up was already handled:** the \"still stopping\" guard also clears when the sidecar reports the session idle. That change was made by another session editing files in my worktree while I worked; it went in with my commit, and I've asked in the claims log that it use its own worktree.\n\nv1.3.0 is still not landed, and the remaining blockers are not ones I can close inside the role you gave me:\n\n- **Unbuilt units:** PF-3, PF-4, VR-2, SB-1, MT-2, BG-1, BG-2, HK-1 to HK-3 and PA-2 have no PR and no claim. GV-1 slices 3–4 and the GV-5 allowlists are unfinished.\n- **Scope:** which of those roll to v1.4 is your call. My recommendation stands: ship what is done plus the rest of GV-1 and GV-5, move the others to v1.4, and say plainly in the release notes that the background-run and hook gates do not apply.\n- **Release authority:** the merge to `main` and the tag need your explicit go-ahead.\n- **Two sessions merging:** #741 and #749 were merged by another session over a standing request for changes. Please confirm who holds the merge queue.\n\nIf you want me to build the unclaimed units myself rather than wait for Codex, say so and I'll start with GV-1 slice 3."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":315,"cache_read_input_tokens":366883,"output_tokens":520,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ep